d 'PIRNEX': module implementing Pairwise Integral Regression and Neural Effects
d
d   pirnex provides experimental panel-data pair-difference neural
d estimation and explanatory ML benchmarks. Research prototype; no
d established	 causal interpretation or validated neural-network
d Wald inference. 
d
d KW: panel data
d KW: neural estimation
d
d Requires: Stata version 16, Python modules numpy, torch, scikit-learn, xgboost, interpret
d
